# SST kills it: U15's input on K7 (pin 10) is stuck at 1 inside the chip, as if the 6502 were always outside the monitor: with SST at ON, every opcode fetch pulls NMI_N low, the monitor's own too, so it stops inside itself over and over. Back at OFF it shows 1C00, where it stopped.
machine bw1
title "SST kills it"
brief "The BW-1 works until SST is slid to ON: then every digit but one goes dark and no key answers. Slid back to OFF, it shows 1C00 85."
fault stuck U15.3B 1
